Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 00:27:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 078/106] Bluetooth: hci_qca: do not claim HFP hw offload on
 wcn3990

Claiming it makes the core hand data path id 1 to the controller, i.e.
tell it the SCO audio arrives over SLIMBus rather than HCI. That is what
the vendor stack does, but it only works with the chip's SLIMBus audio
ports up: with them asleep the controller has no audio source, sends
nothing at all to the headset, and its firmware dies once both
directions are open - taking the phone down with it.

Measured: without this, 0 SCO packets transmitted and a reboot; with it
removed, 1602 packets in 12 s and audio both ways over a real call.

Set it only together with the SLIMBus offload path.
---
 drivers/bluetooth/hci_qca.c | 15 +++++++--------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/bluetooth/hci_qca.c b/drivers/bluetooth/hci_qca.c
index bd4981463..767c1658b 100644
--- a/drivers/bluetooth/hci_qca.c
+++ b/drivers/bluetooth/hci_qca.c
@@ -2143,15 +2143,14 @@ static const struct qca_device_data qca_soc_data_wcn3990 __maybe_unused = {
 	},
 	.num_vregs = 4,
 	/*
-	 * The WCN3990 can carry HFP/SCO audio over its non-HCI (SLIMBus) path
-	 * instead of tunnelling it through HCI. Advertising the offload makes
-	 * the core hand data path id 1 to the controller in
-	 * HCI_Enhanced_Setup_Synchronous_Connection, which is what tells the
-	 * chip to bring its SLIMBus audio ports up - without it those ports
-	 * stay asleep and NACK every register access. Same capability the
-	 * wcn6855/wcn7850/qca2066 already declare.
+	 * Deliberately no QCA_CAP_HFP_HW_OFFLOAD here. Advertising it makes the
+	 * core hand data path id 1 to the controller, i.e. "the SCO audio comes
+	 * over SLIMBus, not over HCI". That is what the vendor stack does, but
+	 * it needs the chip's SLIMBus audio ports up: with them asleep the
+	 * controller has no audio source, transmits nothing, and dies outright
+	 * once both directions are open (firmware gone, phone reboots). Only
+	 * set it together with the SLIMBus offload path.
 	 */
-	.capabilities = QCA_CAP_HFP_HW_OFFLOAD,
 };
 
 static const struct qca_device_data qca_soc_data_wcn3991 __maybe_unused = {
